        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLPQY_qxHE-SyYEQ74FusUqjP2kdd6jut5VnwUv7cFKeh87_A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Cammy did an outstanding job on my tattoo! It was very personal to me and she understood just how important it was. She was able to use my grandmother’s writing from a document to tattoo on me. Her attention to detail is exceptional. The healing process was the easiest I’ve ever had. No scabbing and minimal peeling which was amazing. It was completely healed within 10 days. I highly recommend her and will definitely have her do all my future tattoos ❤️",
        "time": 1710473543,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie Strickland",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114659488470884480856/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULTLTrRYq2_CbyEXOSu6L0Tmnb4iJcne5xamPI_MhOm0RJ4dmJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Camille is such an amazing artist she did the most amazing cover up ever!! Very professional and such a pleasure from creating the design to the actual tattoo session. I highly recommend her and will be definitely going back for more projects!!!",
        "time": 1729901395,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Anne Christoph",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107332774179054769875/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1oNmnWgtI3JTsmHxu0VF2CWbahGv7QHj5BqPQs7RQobsyLNnt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I had a 6 1/2 hour long tattoo done on the left side of my body. This is a very  sensitive area as it goes from hip to underarm… passing through the rib cage… Camille was super gentil, gave me space to breathe and most of all, she kept a solid hand despite my body reacting without my control to the needle. She has patience, she’s thorough and a good sense of humour! Oh! And a GREAT artist!!!",
        "time": 1707161635,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Taylor Grandea",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104362877655600749024/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNzVv_OC7YFRABr4msud5_F_EE8gbzvJUCy2Gstu2chiIRX3s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Booking with this AMAZING artist. Lines are crisp and service is immaculate. Whether I was there for an hour or 5 hours, I was well taken cared of during the entirety of my sessions. I will DEFINITELY be going back.\nPros of the artist:\n-Amazing to talk to\n-Intellectual\n-Very artistically talented\n-Sublime energy\nCons:\n-none, stop reading this review and book your appointment already:)",
        "time": 1707263392,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sarah Holland",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117919104175102580752/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsMvRreRPfFaH7wSQZU_pJ1s1xWUUtiQ2AHHd0kTN2uLQtt2k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very good experience, friendly service, steady hands, beautiful work… I healed fast, had fun, and had no itching or swelling or pain after whatsoever. Cannot speak highly enough of my experience and I WILL be returning for more!! 🥰",
